# Northward (jeuno 24): the fame edge. A level 75 Warrior at Jeuno fame level 3 ((449 + 0 + 0) / 2 = 224): Radeivepart's
# default 159 (no options); finish option 1: no section, not begun. 450 (a GM; 225, level 4): the quest's 159 (1, ...,
# 8).
lists RuludeGardens/Radeivepart/onTrigger RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/159
char zone=RuludeGardens pos=5.9,9,-38.7 job=WAR lvl=75
fame Sandoria 449
login
trigger Radeivepart                 # fame level 3: no section; his default 159
finish option=1                     # the available section's check fails: not begun
fame Sandoria 450                   # a GM
trigger Radeivepart                 # fame level 4: 159 (1, ..., 8)
finish option=1                     # begun
